        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Discover the seven deadly sins and watch as the world crumbles at your fingertips as you create thousands of dastardly deeds.\nCombine fire, earth, wind & air to create demons, beasts, zombies... and much more.\nBeing bad has never been so much fun!",
